The tester has no package variable and no `init()`: its fact is `True`, and its initializer
initializes its imports (`Init.lean`, generated by `etc/gen-init.py`). The instances of its imports
are imported here: `wal`'s, `raftpb`'s, zap's and protobuf's through `wal`'s `Init.lean` (the
server's `BaseApply.lean`, which the WAL specs import anyway), `fileutil`'s and `walpb`'s from their
own `Base.lean`, `durable`'s, and the standard library's (`os`'s through `wal`'s closure).
